{
  "schema": "ppt-master.fact-provenance.v1",
  "topic": "AI计算与传统数据中心计算的本质差异",
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact_id": "F001",
      "claim": "事务型数据库的核心契约之一是原子性：多个步骤作为一个全有或全无的操作，中间状态对其他并发事务不可见。",
      "source_title": "PostgreSQL Tutorial — Transactions",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/postgres/postgres/master/doc/src/sgml/advanced.sgml",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Transactions",
      "supporting_excerpt": "all-or-nothing operation",
      "scope": "传统计算以 OLTP 为代表，并非涵盖所有传统工作负载。",
      "source_sha256": "d36338e5d4c03d71286e1391c8d9f10706bdf1d159ee30ebcbd0f23ff47c1036"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F002",
      "claim": "PostgreSQL 的事务教程把持久性描述为：事务完成并被数据库确认后，结果不会因随后的崩溃而丢失。",
      "source_title": "PostgreSQL Tutorial — Transactions",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/postgres/postgres/master/doc/src/sgml/advanced.sgml",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Transactions",
      "supporting_excerpt": "permanently recorded",
      "scope": "说明事务语义，不代表所有数据库配置具有完全相同的持久化保证。",
      "source_sha256": "d36338e5d4c03d71286e1391c8d9f10706bdf1d159ee30ebcbd0f23ff47c1036"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F003",
      "claim": "神经网络线性层以可学习权重执行仿射变换 y = xAᵀ + b；这是 AI 张量计算的一个具体例子。",
      "source_title": "PyTorch Linear module documentation",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pytorch/pytorch/main/torch/nn/modules/linear.py",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "class Linear",
      "supporting_excerpt": "y = xA^T + b",
      "scope": "不应推广为所有 AI 操作都是矩阵乘法。",
      "source_sha256": "1961ad1a1f650e104b3c7f78d19af2d21bf977e7af6c3fdf2420aad563c9e202"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F004",
      "claim": "PyTorch DDP 为各进程保留模型副本，在反向传播时通过集合通信同步梯度，然后用这些梯度更新模型。",
      "source_title": "PyTorch — Getting Started with Distributed Data Parallel",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pytorch/tutorials/main/intermediate_source/ddp_tutorial.rst",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Introduction",
      "supporting_excerpt": "synchronize gradients and buffers across all processes",
      "scope": "适用于数据并行训练，不代表所有训练范式。",
      "source_sha256": "573819e41f4312c4d5089d61ce666d376fd17d7ae49ac3f1df7ba0aaaae78f9f"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F005",
      "claim": "DDP 进程可位于同一机器或跨机器；模型太大无法装入单 GPU 时，可把数据并行与模型并行结合。",
      "source_title": "PyTorch — Getting Started with Distributed Data Parallel",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pytorch/tutorials/main/intermediate_source/ddp_tutorial.rst",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Introduction; Comparison between DataParallel and DistributedDataParallel",
      "supporting_excerpt": "DDP processes can be placed on the same machine or across machines",
      "scope": "不要把增加卡数等同于线性加速。",
      "source_sha256": "573819e41f4312c4d5089d61ce666d376fd17d7ae49ac3f1df7ba0aaaae78f9f"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F006",
      "claim": "vLLM 的调优文档区分通常偏计算受限的 prefill 和偏内存受限的 decode，并通过混合调度平衡两类操作。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — Optimization and Tuning",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/configuration/optimization.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Chunked Prefill",
      "supporting_excerpt": "compute-bound (prefill) and memory-bound (decode)",
      "scope": "这是典型倾向；实际瓶颈取决于模型、批量、上下文长度与硬件，不是绝对分类。",
      "source_sha256": "59e751196f05fb556acf0af1f88ca813913fe62e27dc324f3dc630bf1675ec7e"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F007",
      "claim": "Chunked prefill 将较大的 prefill 拆成小块，并可与 decode 请求混合成批；默认可用时优先调度 decode。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — Optimization and Tuning",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/configuration/optimization.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Chunked Prefill",
      "supporting_excerpt": "process large prefills in smaller chunks and batch them together with decode requests",
      "scope": "说明分阶段调度，不能由此声称任意环境均获得固定性能提升。",
      "source_sha256": "59e751196f05fb556acf0af1f88ca813913fe62e27dc324f3dc630bf1675ec7e"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F008",
      "claim": "批处理 token 预算影响服务权衡：文档中较小预算有利于 token 间时延，较大预算可改善首 token 时延；具体参数需要测量。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — Optimization and Tuning",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/configuration/optimization.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Performance Tuning with Chunked Prefill",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Smaller values (e.g., 2048) achieve better ITL",
      "scope": "这些建议有版本、负载与硬件适用边界；不把示例参数当通用最优值。",
      "source_sha256": "59e751196f05fb556acf0af1f88ca813913fe62e27dc324f3dc630bf1675ec7e"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F009",
      "claim": "KV cache 空间不足时，vLLM 可抢占请求并在空间恢复后重算；抢占和重算可能恶化端到端时延。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — Optimization and Tuning",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/configuration/optimization.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Preemption",
      "supporting_excerpt": "preemption and recomputation can adversely affect end-to-end latency",
      "scope": "内存容量会影响并发和服务质量；不是只看峰值算力。",
      "source_sha256": "59e751196f05fb556acf0af1f88ca813913fe62e27dc324f3dc630bf1675ec7e"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F010",
      "claim": "张量并行将每层模型参数分布到多个 GPU；它可降低单卡权重压力，但增加并行度也可能带来过多同步开销。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — Optimization and Tuning",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/configuration/optimization.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Preemption; Tensor Parallelism",
      "supporting_excerpt": "increasing this value may cause excessive synchronization overhead",
      "scope": "说明容量与通信的权衡，不是 GPU 越多越好。",
      "source_sha256": "59e751196f05fb556acf0af1f88ca813913fe62e27dc324f3dc630bf1675ec7e"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F011",
      "claim": "流水线并行把模型层分配到不同 GPU，数据并行则复制整个模型到多组 GPU，分别处理请求批次。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — Optimization and Tuning",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/configuration/optimization.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Pipeline Parallelism; Data Parallelism",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Data parallelism replicates the entire model across multiple GPU sets",
      "scope": "模型装得下与吞吐扩展是不同目标。",
      "source_sha256": "59e751196f05fb556acf0af1f88ca813913fe62e27dc324f3dc630bf1675ec7e"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F012",
      "claim": "NCCL 提供 all-reduce、all-gather、reduce-scatter 等 GPU 集合通信，可跨单机和多机，并支持 PCIe、NVLink 及网络传输。",
      "source_title": "NVIDIA NCCL README",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NVIDIA/nccl/master/README.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Introduction",
      "supporting_excerpt": "implementing all-reduce, all-gather, reduce, broadcast, reduce-scatter",
      "scope": "通信结构由并行方式和实际拓扑决定；不声称 AI 独占高性能互联。",
      "source_sha256": "d81efb277cb5113e703bcbfa56f6b3eba561dce9feb07435a336b65339246018"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F013",
      "claim": "vLLM 提供 Intel/AMD x86、ARM AArch64、Apple silicon 等 CPU 后端，因此 AI 推理并不在定义上等同于 GPU 计算。",
      "source_title": "vLLM — CPU Installation",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/main/docs/getting_started/installation/cpu.md",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "CPU",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Intel/AMD x86",
      "scope": "支持运行不等于所有模型、精度和功能在各平台一致，也不证明性能等价。",
      "source_sha256": "d1e45f088cab64a38b7f3d368a39ca00126b8b1b437a85240c787649b738b29c"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F014",
      "claim": "MLPerf Inference 将服务端场景的性能与时延约束关联；离线场景则衡量吞吐，不能不加区分地比较两者。",
      "source_title": "MLCommons — MLPerf Inference Rules",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlcommons/inference_policies/master/inference_rules.adoc",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "Scenarios table",
      "supporting_excerpt": "Maximum Poisson throughput parameter supported",
      "scope": "采用方法论而非引用某一硬件跑分。",
      "source_sha256": "94c69f01f1e0be24dc057180af6db878d1f5339fd31d54cbe5c386f8e198ce08"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F015",
      "claim": "MLPerf 的 LLM 基准同时定义 TTFT 与 TPOT：前者是首 token 时延，后者是输出 token 的平均间隔。",
      "source_title": "MLCommons — MLPerf Inference Rules",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlcommons/inference_policies/master/inference_rules.adoc",
      "classification": "external",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-16",
      "source_locator": "LLM latency footnote",
      "supporting_excerpt": "time per output token (TPOT)",
      "scope": "TPOT 是平均间隔，不等同于每个 token 间隔分布或尾时延。",
      "source_sha256": "94c69f01f1e0be24dc057180af6db878d1f5339fd31d54cbe5c386f8e198ce08"
    },
    {
      "fact_id": "F016",
      "claim": "MLPerf 的封闭基准定义质量与时延目标；推理性能比较需要同时说明模型、任务、质量及服务约束。",
      "source_title": "MLCommons — MLPerf Inference Rules",
      "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlcommons/inference_policies/master/inference_rules.adoc",
      "classification": "external",
